--
-- conformance: pending
-- Lua/Luau treats nil as false in a condition. Waluau deliberately requires
-- if-expression conditions to be bool rather than applying Lua truthiness.
-- Split from conformance/luau/ifelseexpr.walu in original source order.
-- Upstream source lines 53-54.

assert(if nil then false else true)
